<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat futures trade mixed in modest trade.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat futures trade mixed in modest trade.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian wheat futures traded were mixed on Monday after posting sharp falls on Friday.</p>
<p>Grain traders said local trading attracted a modest level of interest following a firmer trading session in the United States on Friday.</p>
<p>January 1997 wheat contined to decline, slipping by 50 cents to settle at A$163.50 a tonne.</p>
<p>Wheat futures have been under pressure on expectation of a big crop as growers go into harvest, traders said.</p>
